WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.651 --> 00:00:19.309
- [Evan] If you just work for
money, you'll never make it.

00:00:19.309 --> 00:00:23.322
But if you love what you're
doing, success will be yours.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:24.155
Ray Kroc.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:30.119
I want to make a million dollars
before I turn X years old.

00:00:30.119 --> 00:00:31.697
Sound familiar?

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:34.821
Most new entrepreneurs are
just trying to make money

00:00:34.821 --> 00:00:36.917
and that's why they fail.

00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:38.467
They're tired of working for someone else

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:40.712
and think you can strike
it rich by branching off

00:00:40.712 --> 00:00:42.252
on your own.

00:00:42.252 --> 00:00:44.045
You're partly right.

00:00:44.045 --> 00:00:46.710
If you look at any list of
the world's wealthiest people

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.293
and remove those who had inherited wealth,

00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:52.166
almost everyone else is an entrepreneur.

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:55.136
You don't make real money
working for someone else.

00:00:55.136 --> 00:00:59.303
But and this is a huge but,
if money is your only goal

00:01:00.456 --> 00:01:02.389
then you'll never be rich.

00:01:02.389 --> 00:01:05.141
Look at the list at the most
successful entrepreneurs

00:01:05.141 --> 00:01:08.263
and you'll see that none of
them are driven by the money.

00:01:08.263 --> 00:01:10.725
They want to change the
way something is done.

00:01:10.725 --> 00:01:12.379
They want to have an impact.

00:01:12.379 --> 00:01:14.783
They want to leave a legacy.

00:01:14.783 --> 00:01:16.757
To be successful as an entrepreneur,

00:01:16.757 --> 00:01:18.852
you need to build a
business around your passion

00:01:18.852 --> 00:01:23.100
and use your one word as
your operating philosophy.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:26.159
You're not running a charity
here, unless you are.

00:01:26.159 --> 00:01:27.465
Money is important.

00:01:27.465 --> 00:01:29.365
You're here to create profits and wealth

00:01:29.365 --> 00:01:32.006
but it's not the most important thing.

00:01:32.006 --> 00:01:34.558
Success leaves clues.

00:01:34.558 --> 00:01:36.388
Still don't believe that
money should never be your

00:01:36.388 --> 00:01:37.979
primary goal?

00:01:37.979 --> 00:01:39.907
Here are some more examples to follow.

00:01:39.907 --> 00:01:42.129
I encourage you to look up
your favorite entrepreneur

00:01:42.129 --> 00:01:46.182
and see how they got started
and what their priorities were.

00:01:46.182 --> 00:01:48.905
Richard Branson said, never
go into business purely

00:01:48.905 --> 00:01:52.590
to make money, if that's the
sole motive you're better off

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:53.757
doing nothing.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:58.111
Chris Gardner said, you
have to be committed

00:01:58.111 --> 00:02:00.439
and you have to find something
that you are passionate

00:02:00.439 --> 00:02:03.494
about and forget about money.

00:02:03.494 --> 00:02:06.642
Joyce Clyde Hall said, if
a man goes into business

00:02:06.642 --> 00:02:09.167
with only the idea of
making a lot of money,

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:11.059
chances are he won't.

00:02:11.059 --> 00:02:13.421
But if he puts service and quality first,

00:02:13.421 --> 00:02:15.674
the money will take care of itself.

00:02:15.674 --> 00:02:18.751
Producing a first class
product that is a real need

00:02:18.751 --> 00:02:21.206
is a much stronger motivation for success

00:02:21.206 --> 00:02:22.706
than getting rich.

00:02:23.795 --> 00:02:27.469
Oprah Winfrey said, what I
know is, is that if you do work

00:02:27.469 --> 00:02:30.152
that you love and work that fulfills you,

00:02:30.152 --> 00:02:33.348
the rest will come and I
truly believe that the reason

00:02:33.348 --> 00:02:36.239
I've been able to be so
financially successful

00:02:36.239 --> 00:02:39.952
is because my focus has
never ever for one minute

00:02:39.952 --> 00:02:40.869
been money.

00:02:41.897 --> 00:02:45.432
Walt Disney said, Disneyland
is a work of love.

00:02:45.432 --> 00:02:47.860
We didn't go into Disneyland
just with the idea

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.984
of making money.

00:02:49.984 --> 00:02:52.764
Donald Trump said, the most
important thing in life

00:02:52.764 --> 00:02:55.312
is to love what you're doing
because that's the only way

00:02:55.312 --> 00:02:57.175
you'll ever be good at.

00:02:57.175 --> 00:02:59.800
Money was never a motivation
for me except as a way

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.159
to keep score.

00:03:01.159 --> 00:03:03.847
The real excitement is
in playing the game.

00:03:03.847 --> 00:03:06.824
And Jennifer Lopez said,
if you focus on the money,

00:03:06.824 --> 00:03:09.395
you're not going to get anywhere.

00:03:09.395 --> 00:03:12.166
You can want to be successful
but at the end of the day,

00:03:12.166 --> 00:03:14.824
if money is your motivation,
if that's how shallow your

00:03:14.824 --> 00:03:17.385
outlook is on life, then
you're going to be such

00:03:17.385 --> 00:03:20.059
an empty person because
there's nothing driving

00:03:20.059 --> 00:03:23.476
you from the inside, there's no passion.

